{"ticker":"EXE","updated":"2026-11-27T22:52:43Z","profile":{"longName":"Expand Energy Corporation","shortName":"Expand Energy Corporation","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas E&P","country":"United States","website":"https://www.expandenergy.com","fullTimeEmployees":1600,"marketCap":20197218304,"trailingPE":7.545297,"forwardPE":11.35073,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.5596308,"pegRatio":0.03,"targetMeanPrice":120.48148,"targetHighPrice":156.0,"targetLowPrice":92.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":27,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.116,"earningsGrowth":-0.018,"grossMargins":0.45861,"operatingMargins":0.28934,"profitMargins":0.21259001,"totalRevenue":12949999616,"beta":0.37,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":126.621,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":80.46,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.65},"summary":"Expand Energy Corporation operates as an independent natural gas production company in the United States. The company engages in acquisition, exploration, and development of properties to produce oil, natural gas, and natural gas liquids. It holds interests in the Marcellus Shale in the northern Appalachian Basin in Pennsylvania; the Marcellus and Utica Shales in Ohio and West Virginia; and the Haynesville and Bossier Shales in Louisiana and Texas. Expand Energy Corporation was formerly known as Chesapeake Energy Corporation and changed its name to Expand Energy Corporation in October 2024. The company was founded in 1989 and is based in Spring, Texas.","summary_zh":"Expand Energy Corporation 在美国作为一家独立的天然气生产公司运营。该公司从事收购、勘探和开发石油、天然气和液化天然气业务。它擁有賓夕法尼亞州阿巴拉契亞盆地北部馬塞勒斯頁岩的權益；俄亥俄州和西弗吉尼亞州的馬塞勒斯頁岩和尤蒂卡頁岩；以及路易斯安那州和德克薩斯州的海恩斯維爾頁岩和波西爾頁岩。 Expand Energy Corporation 前身為切薩皮克能源公司 (Chesapeake Energy Corporation)，於 2024 年 10 月更名為 Expand Energy Corporation。该公司成立于 1989 年，总部位于德克萨斯州斯普林。","sector_zh":"活力","industry_zh":"石油和天然氣勘探與生產","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":105.44,"h":108.0,"l":105.155,"c":106.81,"v":4969300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":106.6,"h":108.36,"l":106.18,"c":106.24,"v"